{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35664","headline":"兵後寻边三首 一 · 李山甫","name":"兵後寻边三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千里烟砂尽日昏，战余烧罢闭重门。\n新成劒戟皆农器，旧着衣裳尽血痕。\n卷地朔风吹白骨，柱天青气泣幽魂。\n自怜长策无人问，羞戴儒冠傍塞垣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}